    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.2/p@22377",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FIRST SENATOR.\nSo, your opinion is, Aufidius,\nThat they of Rome are entered in our counsels\nAnd know how we proceed.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.2/p@22377/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 14,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.2/p@22377/line-2",
          "start": 15,
          "end": 45,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.2/p@22377/line-3",
          "start": 46,
          "end": 91,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.2/p@22377/line-4",
          "start": 92,
          "end": 116,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 842089,
        "end": 842245,
        "line": 31729,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@22377",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FIRST SENATOR.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 14
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.2/p@22537",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "AUFIDIUS.\nIs it not yours?\nWhat ever have been thought on in this state\nThat could be brought to bodily act ere Rome\nHad circumvention? ’Tis not four days gone\nSince I heard thence. These are the words—I think\nI have the letter here. Yes, here it is.\n[Reads.] They have pressed a power, but it is not known\nWhether for east or west. The dearth is great.\nThe people mutinous; and, it is rumoured,\nCominius, Martius your old enemy,\nWho is of Rome worse hated than of you,—\nAnd Titus Lartius, a most valiant Roman,\nThese three lead on this preparation\nWhither ’tis bent. Most likely ’tis for you.\nConsider of it.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 252,
          "end": 257
        },
        {
          "tag": "i",
